    {
      "id": "c-small-n",
      "kind": "caveat",
      "text": "n is 3 per cell; these are directions for a larger study, not results."
    },
    {
      "id": "c-one-task",
      "kind": "caveat",
      "text": "One task, t01, carries all the signal."
    },
    {
      "id": "c-one-model",
      "kind": "caveat",
      "text": "One model and one agent harness; the effect may differ elsewhere."
    },
    {
      "id": "c-condition-wording",
      "kind": "caveat",
      "text": "The effect size depends on whether the condition text happens to name the right surface."
    },
    {
      "id": "c-ceiling",
      "kind": "caveat",
      "text": "t02 and t03 are at ceiling for this model and need harder variants before they add information."
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-pilot-paragraph",
      "kind": "claim",
      "text": "On the packaged-asset task the agent claimed completion at confidence 0.95 or above in all six baseline and verify-your-work runs while the installed package crashed; when each claim had to name the artefact it exercised, the agent tested the publishable artefact in every run and found the failure."
    },
    {
      "id": "t04-stale-config-hard",
      "kind": "task",
      "text": "stale-config, version 2: version is a number composed into the URL; production override in deploy/.env.production"
